Changes of KaSCPar for compatibility with JJTree und JavaCC in version 5.0:

- all constant definitions from SCParserVisitor.java have been moved to
  SCDumpVisitor.java and become static 

########
Changes in SC2AST.jjt 08/23/13 (delete [] support)
########

Added methods:
void delete_array_expression() :
{}
{    ( "::" )? "delete" "[" "]" cast_expression()
}

Changes in method primary_expression:
> LOOKAHEAD( ("::")? "delete" ("[ "]")? ) 
> (
>    delete_expression()
> )

< LOOKAHEAD( ("::")? "delete") 
< (
<   LOOKAHEAD(2) 
<   delete_array_expression() 
<   |
<   delete_expression()
< ) 

Changes in method delete_expression():
> {    ( "::" )? "delete" ( "[" "]" )? cast_expression()

< {    ( "::" )? "delete" cast_expression()


